WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:03.939
It's never too early to get excited for the
next big blockbuster, right?

00:00:03.939 --> 00:00:08.231
From a bevy of superheroes to re-imaginings
of your favorite classics, clear your calendar

00:00:08.231 --> 00:00:12.759
all the way through 2019, because here are
just a few of the big-budget flicks you're

00:00:12.759 --> 00:00:15.650
going to want to get on line for now.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:16.650
Hellboy

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:22.080
Stranger Things star David Harbour will unveil
his new take on Hellboy in January 2019, joining

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:26.930
director Neil Marshall for what's described
as a gritty take on the original Mike Mignola

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:27.930
comics.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:31.310
Harbour has said the movie will use a "darker
tone" to differentiate itself from Guillermo

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:35.820
del Toro's adaptations, adding that it'll
be more of "a character piece" about Hellboy's

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:36.820
struggle.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:40.339
While Harbour's take on Hellboy looks spot
on, the rest of the cast is also packed with

00:00:40.339 --> 00:00:45.000
potential, including Milla Jovovich as the
villainous Blood Queen, Ian McShane as Hellboy's

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.329
adopted father, and Sasha Lane as Alice Monaghan.

00:00:48.329 --> 00:00:52.890
The movie also has signed Lost's Daniel Dae
Kim to play comics favorite Major Ben Daimio.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:56.999
The real question, however, is if there'll
be pancakes.

00:00:56.999 --> 00:00:58.280
Glass

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:02.719
M. Night Shyamalan continues his surprise
superhero trilogy with Glass, a sequel to

00:01:02.719 --> 00:01:08.210
2017's Split, whose final act unexpectedly
tied in with 2000's Unbreakable.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:12.270
The movie will bring back all the main players
from both films, including Bruce Willis, Samuel

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:15.979
L. Jackson, James McAvoy, and Anya Taylor-Joy.

00:01:15.979 --> 00:01:19.600
Details are still under wraps, and given how
much Shyamalan loves twists, it'll probably

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:24.159
stay that way until the film's January 2019
release date.

00:01:24.159 --> 00:01:25.640
Silver and Black

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:31.009
Sony's Spider-Man universe gets a female-led
entry in February 2019 with Silver and Black,

00:01:31.009 --> 00:01:35.259
headed by The Secret Life of Bees director
Gina Prince-Bythewood, who also directed Marvel's

00:01:35.259 --> 00:01:37.200
Cloak and Dagger pilot for Freeform.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:41.399
She'll also assist with the script, alongside
Thor: Ragnarok's Chris Yost.

00:01:41.399 --> 00:01:45.610
The movie is set to follow Marvel's mercenary
Silver Sable and the burglar Black Cat in

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:48.579
a pairing that Prince-Bythewood compares to
Thelma and Louise.

00:01:48.579 --> 00:01:53.090
The dark film will reportedly bring in the
cyborg supervillain Gaunt, and his enforcers

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:55.740
Tarantula and Scorpion as the villains.

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.630
Yep, this guy.

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.469
"I beat Spider-Man!

00:01:59.469 --> 00:02:04.940
Taken out by the one… the only…

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:05.940
Scorpion!"

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.500
Chaos Walking

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:13.030
Your next favorite YA adaptation will hit
theaters in March 2019 with Chaos Walking,

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:16.319
a sci-fi adventure based on the trilogy by
Patrick Ness.

00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:20.480
The movie takes place on a planet where almost
all the women have been killed off by a virus

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:23.440
and living creatures can hear each other's
thoughts.

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:27.890
As the story begins, a young man played by
Tom Holland meets a woman played by Daisy

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:31.140
Ridley... and she may have the key to unlocking
the world's many secrets.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:35.659
Though it's not as if Daisy Ridley as a girl
with mysterious powers is much of a stretch.

00:02:35.659 --> 00:02:40.470
The movie has an amazing supporting cast that
includes Oscar nominee Demian Bichir, two-time

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:46.370
Golden Globe nominee David Oyelowo, Tony winner
Cynthia Erivo, critical favorite Mads Mikkelsen,

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:48.069
and pop star Nick Jonas.

00:02:48.069 --> 00:02:49.890
Mark your calendars now.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.010
Dumbo

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:54.860
Disney has given a number of animated classics
the live-action treatment, but one of the

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:59.799
most intriguing is Tim Burton's Dumbo, starring
Colin Farrell as Holt, a former circus performer

00:02:59.799 --> 00:03:03.440
whose life is turned upside down after he
returns home from the war.

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:07.770
Holt teams up with circus owner Max Medici,
played by Danny DeVito, to care for a newborn

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.879
elephant whose giant ears have already made
him a laughingstock.

00:03:10.879 --> 00:03:15.980
The movie's all-star cast also includes Michael
Keaton, Alan Arkin, and Eva Green.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:20.000
With Burton and a whole host of amazing actors
on board, this should be a worthy retelling

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.790
of the classic tale when it's released in
March 2019… probably without these guys.

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:27.700
The Voyage of Doctor Dolittle

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:31.620
Putting down his Iron Man helmet for a while,
Robert Downey Jr. will put his stamp on the

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:35.720
legendary character of Doctor Dolittle in
April of 2019.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:40.480
The Voyage of Doctor Dolittle, like its predecessors,
will also be based on Hugh Lofting's original

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:41.610
children's books.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:46.000
The movie comes from a script by Syriana's
Stephen Gaghan, who's also set to direct.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:50.140
Plot details are unknown, but we can only
hope Downey gets the chance to use his glorious

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:54.989
pipes should the movie end up being a musical
like the 1967 original.

00:03:54.989 --> 00:03:56.079
Aladdin

00:03:56.079 --> 00:04:00.480
Guy Ritchie will reveal his "ambitious and
non-traditional' take on Aladdin in May of

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:05.860
2019, with Mena Massoud taking on the title
role alongside Power Rangers star Naomi Scott

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:10.569
as Jasmine, who landed their roles after beating
out thousands of hopefuls in a worldwide casting

00:04:10.569 --> 00:04:11.569
call.

00:04:11.569 --> 00:04:15.620
The rest of the cast includes Will Smith stepping
into Robin Williams' role as the Genie and

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:18.299
Marwan Kenzari playing the villainous Jafar.

00:04:18.299 --> 00:04:23.610
The cast also includes Saturday Night Live's
Nasim Pedrad and Into the Woods' Billy Magnussen.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:27.680
We have trust in the Disney machine to make
this a magical trip to the theater.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.870
Cowboy Ninja Viking

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:34.220
Chris Pratt made a very quick journey from
Parks and Recreation schlub to action hero,

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:38.919
and his big June 2019 outing will find the
actor taking the lead in Cowboy Ninja Viking,

00:04:38.919 --> 00:04:41.560
based on the Image Comics series of the same
name.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:45.320
This time, Pratt is a new kind of assassin
who's able to combine the skills of three

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:47.090
legendary kinds of heroes.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:48.660
It's been a long time in the making.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:53.600
Pratt first signed on in 2014, but when he
was unable to film due to his hectic schedule,

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:56.520
a couple directors dropped out, waylaying
things further.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:00.750
Still, with script work from Deadpool's Rhett
Reese and Paul Wernick and The Hangover II's

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:04.190
Craig Mazin, this ridiculous premise has a
pretty good shot at paying off.

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:07.220
When are ninjas NOT entertaining?

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:08.770
Top Gun 2

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:11.430
Maverick will be back in July 2019.

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:15.410
Oblivion director Joseph Kosinski is set to
reunite with Tom Cruise for the long-awaited

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:20.360
Top Gun sequel, which will be set in the world
of drone technology and fifth generation fighters—and

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.330
the end of the era of dogfighting.

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:26.240
Producer Jerry Bruckheimer is on board to
return for the sequel, and while it's unclear

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:30.380
whether other actors from the original cast
will be back, Val Kilmer has said he's ready

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:32.840
to step up should he get the call.

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:34.319
Artemis Fowl

00:05:34.319 --> 00:05:38.560
Millions of readers remember Eoin Colfer's
Artemis Fowl novels, or their graphic novel

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:43.199
adaptations, which followed precocious criminal
mastermind Artemis through a series of fantastic

00:05:43.199 --> 00:05:44.819
adventures around the globe.

00:05:44.819 --> 00:05:48.360
The books are ripe for the film franchise
treatment, with Kenneth Branagh set to direct

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:52.680
an adaptation, scheduled to arrive in theaters
in August 2019.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:56.470
While no casting announcements have been made
yet, this looks like a family-friendly film

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.500
saga in the making.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:00.199
Gemini Man

00:06:00.199 --> 00:06:04.840
Will Smith fans have more than just Aladdin
to look forward to in October of 2019.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:09.110
The actor is also set to star in Ang Lee's
Gemini Man as an aging assassin trying to

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:10.509
get out of the business.

00:06:10.509 --> 00:06:14.710
Things get complicated when he has to fight
against his own, much younger clone.

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:19.430
Gemini was first pitched to Disney over twenty
years ago, but the execs had to wait until

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:22.910
visual effects could effectively change the
age of the lead actor.

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:27.610
This promises to be a futuristic action thriller
with a nifty twist—and twice as many Smiths

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:28.770
is never a bad thing.

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:29.770
Or is it?

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:32.800
"Sharks have been around for longer than trees.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:36.580
That one's hard to believe, but it's actually
true."

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.449
James Bond 25

00:06:38.449 --> 00:06:42.310
Daniel Craig returns just one more time as
James Bond in the character's 25th feature

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.370
film in November 2019.

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:49.100
Blade Runner 2049's Denis Villeneuve, Hell
or High Water's David Mackenzie, and '71's

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:52.180
Yann Demange are reportedly the frontrunners
to direct.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:55.590
A lot about the movie is still being hammered
out right now, but none of it threatens to

00:06:55.590 --> 00:07:00.410
revoke 007's long-standing license to kill
at the box office.

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:01.820
Wonder Woman 2

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:06.879
As the DCEU's highest-grossing film to date
in the U.S., it makes sense that Warner Bros.

00:07:06.879 --> 00:07:11.250
quickly ordered a sequel to Wonder Woman,
set to be released in December of 2019.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:14.680
The movie will also bring back director Patty
Jenkins as co-writer.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:18.620
While plot details have been kept tightly
under wraps, Jenkins has said she'd like the

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:23.580
film to bring Diana to America after the events
of Wonder Woman, and before Dawn of Justice.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:27.410
The sequel is also reportedly said to have
found a way to bring back Chris Pine, so look

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:32.569
forward to more action, fun, and maybe even
a supervillain without a silly mustache.

00:07:32.569 --> 00:07:33.569
Thanks for watching!

00:07:33.569 --> 00:07:35.860
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:37.800
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

